{"detail": {"templateUuid": "bcf1dee74069431899086ffbe6780e77", "projectUuid": "c80385f6b2544dd3be51461d9366c810", "name": "跟着高德去扫街 | 杨老肥，不肥！", "description": "凯里\n一座泡在酸汤里的城\n红酸、白酸、糟辣、折耳根\n一万种酸\n一万种活法\n但你问凯里人凯里什么味儿？\n没人说得清\n因为味儿不在嘴里\n在巷子深处那口锅里\n杨老肥\n嘴嘴食堂\n十年\n朋友来了她敬酒\n客人来了她炒菜\n不服？\n打开高德\n——自己看\n————————————\n一城一味\n黔东南的味是酸\n酸是啥？\n酸是不服\n酸是滚烫\n酸是一个女人站在灶台前\n一勺一勺\n把这座城的魂熬出来\n————————————\n一勺一魂\n杨老肥\n就是代表“凯里”的性格\n那她到底肥不肥？\n跟着高德去扫街\n好店，值得你来“窜”！！\n献给凯里这座宝藏城市的街角情歌！\n#扫街榜AI创意大赛 #AI全能艺术家计划", "coverUrl": "/assets/0c1bb47fa6444132.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430/25751efb90bc9d5bd8b44177205d00503dc56cd5.mp4", "snapshotId": 36912, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5919496, "ownerUuid": "d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430", "avatar": "/assets/3e3bb6164390ba95.webp", "nickname": "有無劇院", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 3, "tags": [{"id": 3045, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "走，我们扫街去", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3045/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3046, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-人间烟火", "parentTag": 3045, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3045/3046", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1205, "code": "culture_tourism", "tagLabel": "文旅政媒", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1205/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 5, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verify